# Line endings are a determinism input (N3, AC-DET-2).
#
# From Phase 3 onward the generative pipeline reads `assets/params/*.ron` and friends. A
# file checked out with CRLF on Windows and LF on Linux is a *different file*, so any hash
# of its bytes — and therefore any tree generated from it — differs by platform, for no
# reason a user could ever discover. Every file the build or the pipeline reads is pinned
# to LF here.
#
# Markdown is deliberately absent: the ratified documents in `docs/` are already committed
# with CRLF, nothing hashes them, and renormalizing them would churn the record for no gain.

*.rs      text eol=lf
*.toml    text eol=lf
*.ron     text eol=lf
*.wgsl    text eol=lf
*.yml     text eol=lf
*.yaml    text eol=lf
Cargo.lock     text eol=lf
.gitignore     text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ttf binary
